{# Standalone print document (no base.html.twig) - rendered by Gotenberg, which has no browser
   origin of its own, so nothing here loads an asset by relative URL.

   The document a teacher hands a Qualiopi auditor for one matière × one classe. Its order is the
   order the questions get asked in: what was planned and did it happen, how the objectives are
   broken down over the year, and by what methods each séance is run. Every figure is measured from
   the placements on real créneaux rather than stated - an auditor's first question is where a
   number comes from, and "the timetable" is the only answer worth giving.

   `undated` is the second document (App\Enum\ProgressionExportMode): no date anywhere, volumes and
   months only, and the auto-planner's proposal counted wherever nothing was validated. It exists so
   that a justification file costs no placement work and does not go stale every time the timetable
   moves - a global view rather than an exact one. Every divergence below asks that one flag. #}
{% set undated = undated|default(false) %}
{% set progression = data.progression %}
{% set program = progression.program %}
{% set topic = progression.topic %}
{% set schoolYear = program ? program.schoolYear : null %}
{% set yearLabel = schoolYear and schoolYear.startDate and schoolYear.endDate ? schoolYear.startDate|date('Y') ~ '–' ~ schoolYear.endDate|date('Y') : '' %}
{% set teacherName = progression.teacher ? (progression.teacher.displayName ?? progression.teacher.username) : '—' %}
{# Co-animation: the cover names EVERY formateur, with the group their créneaux say they hold. Read
   from the roster the exporter passes in, which measures it off the timetable rather than storing
   it — so a créneau that moves rooms next week moves the document with it. #}
{% set roster = roster|default([]) %}
{% set coAnimated = roster|length > 1 %}
{% set teacherNames = roster|map(r => r.teacher.displayName ?? r.teacher.username) %}
{% set programLabel = program ? program.displayShortName : '—' %}
{# The programme's short name IS the cohort's name on most formations, and the cover printed it
   twice ("SIO1 — SIO1"). The cohort is named only when it says something the short name does not -
   compared against the RAW short name rather than against programLabel, whose "TEST - " prefix and
   " - (masqué)" suffix would otherwise make every decorated programme look different from its own
   promotion and print the repetition again. #}
{% set cohortLabel = program and program.cohort and program.cohort.name|lower != program.shortName|lower ? program.cohort.name : '' %}
{% set docTitle = 'Progression pédagogique — ' ~ (topic ? topic.name : '—') ~ ' × ' ~ (program ? program.displayShortName : '—') %}
{# The undated document's unit of time. A single month prints alone rather than as "septembre 2026 →
   septembre 2026", and the month names come from the same translation keys as the progression's own
   month navigation - lowercase, as French writes them inside a sentence. #}
{% macro monthRange(firstDay, lastDay) %}
    {%- set from = ('monthFull' ~ firstDay|date('n') ~ 'Label')|trans ~ ' ' ~ firstDay|date('Y') -%}
    {%- set to = lastDay ? ('monthFull' ~ lastDay|date('n') ~ 'Label')|trans ~ ' ' ~ lastDay|date('Y') : null -%}
    {{- from -}}
    {%- if to and to != from %} → {{ to }}{% endif -%}
{% endmacro %}
{% import _self as fmt %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ docTitle }}</title>
<style>
    /* A4 portrait. The page MARGINS are not set here: Gotenberg drives them as conversion
       parameters (App\Service\GotenbergPageSetup), and Chromium's print pipeline ignores @page
       margins when it receives its own. Only the size is stated, which preferCssPageSize honours.

       The running footer is likewise NOT in this document. It used to be a `position: fixed` band,
       and Chromium repeated it at the TOP of every page after the first, straight across the text -
       nothing reserved a strip for it, since the @page margin it was measured against was the one
       being ignored. It is now templates/progression/_qualiopi_footer.html.twig, handed to Gotenberg
       as its footer, printed inside the bottom margin where it cannot collide with anything. */
    @page { size: A4 portrait; }
    * { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; box-sizing: border-box; }
    /* The 2px on the right are not decoration, they are the width bug. Chromium lays this document
       out in a box ROUNDED UP to a whole CSS pixel - 704px for the 186mm between the 12mm margins,
       which is 703.05px - and then clips the page to the real 186mm. So the last ~0.26mm of every
       `width: 100%` block falls outside the clip: a 0.5pt right border (0.26mm wide, drawn from
       185.99mm to 186.27mm) is cut down to 0.02mm and disappears, which is why the bordered banners
       and the tables printed open on their right edge. Measured on the content stream: the block
       ended at 198.17mm with the clip at 197.92mm; with these 2px it ends at 197.64mm and the border
       is painted whole. Reserving pixels rather than millimetres is deliberate - the overflow IS a
       pixel-rounding artefact, and it stays one whatever the margins become. */
    body { margin: 0; padding-right: 2px; font-family: 'Source Sans 3', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; color: #1b2430; font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.45; }
    h1, h2, h3 { font-family: Spectral, Georgia, serif; margin: 0; }

    .qp-cover { border: 1.2pt solid #1F4E79; padding: 9mm; margin-bottom: 7mm; }
    .qp-cover__kicker { font-size: 8pt; letter-spacing: 1.4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #2E74B5; }
    .qp-cover__title { font-size: 21pt; color: #1F4E79; margin: 3mm 0 1mm; }
    .qp-cover__sub { font-size: 12pt; color: #33415c; }
    .qp-cover__teacher { font-size: 10pt; color: #55637a; margin-top: 1.5mm; }

    .qp-id { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 6mm; }
    .qp-id th { text-align: left; width: 38mm; padding: 1.6mm 2mm; background: #eef3f9; border: 0.5pt solid #b9c8da; font-weight: 600; font-size: 8.5pt; }
    .qp-id td { padding: 1.6mm 2mm; border: 0.5pt solid #b9c8da; }

    h2.qp-h2 { font-size: 13pt; color: #1F4E79; border-bottom: 1pt solid #1F4E79; padding-bottom: 1.2mm; margin: 7mm 0 3mm; }
    h3.qp-h3 { font-size: 10.5pt; color: #2E74B5; margin: 4mm 0 1.5mm; }
    .qp-crit { font-size: 7.5pt; color: #6b7688; font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 2.5mm; }

    .qp-kpis { display: flex; gap: 3mm; margin-bottom: 3mm; }
    /* min-width: 0 is what keeps the fourth tile on the page: a flex item refuses to shrink below
       its min-content width by default, and "ÉVAL. D · F · S" under a 15pt figure is wider than the
       quarter it is given - so the row overflowed the right margin and the last tile was printed
       cut in half. */
    .qp-kpi { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; border: 0.5pt solid #b9c8da; background: #f7fafd; padding: 2.5mm; }
    .qp-kpi__v { font-family: Spectral, Georgia, serif; font-size: 15pt; color: #1F4E79; white-space: nowrap; }
    .qp-kpi__l { font-size: 7.5pt; color: #6b7688; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .5px; }

    table.qp-t { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 2mm; }
    table.qp-t th { background: #1F4E79; color: #fff; text-align: left; padding: 1.4mm 2mm; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: 600; }
    table.qp-t td { border: 0.5pt solid #c2cddb; padding: 1.4mm 2mm; vertical-align: top; font-size: 8.5pt; }
    table.qp-t tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #f7fafd; }
    .qp-t--tight td, .qp-t--tight th { font-size: 8pt; }
    /* A table that has to break keeps its header on the next page, and no row is ever cut in two. */
    table.qp-t thead { display: table-header-group; }
    table.qp-t tr { break-inside: avoid; }

    /* Kept whole when it fits on a page - but a séquence with a dozen séances does not, and forcing
       it would print a mostly-blank page and overflow anyway. So the block may break, and what is
       glued instead is the join that would read as a mistake: a title at the foot of a page with its
       content overleaf. */
    .qp-seq { margin-bottom: 5mm; }
    .qp-seq__head { background: #eef3f9; border-left: 2.5pt solid #1F4E79; padding: 2mm 3mm; margin-bottom: 2mm; break-inside: avoid; break-after: avoid; }
    .qp-seq__title { font-family: Spectral, Georgia, serif; font-size: 11.5pt; color: #1F4E79; }
    .qp-seq__meta { font-size: 8pt; color: #55637a; }
    .qp-field { margin: 1.5mm 0; font-size: 8.5pt; }
    .qp-field__l { font-weight: 600; color: #33415c; }
    .qp-prose { margin: 0; }
    .qp-prose p { margin: 0 0 1mm; }

    .qp-nature { display: inline-block; padding: 0.3mm 1.6mm; border-radius: 1mm; font-size: 7.5pt; font-weight: 600; }
    .qp-nature--diagnostic { background: #e3eefa; color: #1F4E79; }
    .qp-nature--formative { background: #fbf1dc; color: #8a6100; }
    .qp-nature--summative { background: #fae4e4; color: #9b2226; }

    .qp-muted { color: #8a93a3; }
    .qp-note { border: 0.5pt solid #b9c8da; background: #f7fafd; padding: 2.5mm 3mm; font-size: 8pt; color: #55637a; break-inside: avoid; }
    .qp-redelivery { display: block; margin-top: 0.8mm; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #55637a; font-style: italic; }
    /* The « Co-animée » mark on a séquence head. Print colours only - no background image and no
       web font, the document has no origin of its own. */
    .qp-coanim { display: inline-block; margin-left: 2.5mm; padding: 0.3mm 1.6mm; border-radius: 0.8mm;
                 background: #1F4E79; color: #fff; font-size: 6.5pt; font-weight: 700;
                 letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; vertical-align: 0.6mm; }
    h2.qp-h2, h3.qp-h3 { break-after: avoid; }
    .qp-break { break-before: page; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

{# ---- Cover page: who, what, when, how many ------------------------------ #}
<div class="qp-cover">
    <div class="qp-cover__kicker">Progression pédagogique{{ yearLabel ? ' · ' ~ yearLabel }}</div>
    <h1 class="qp-cover__title">{{ topic ? topic.name : '—' }}</h1>
    <div class="qp-cover__sub">{{ programLabel }}{% if cohortLabel %} — {{ cohortLabel }}{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="qp-cover__teacher">{{ coAnimated ? teacherNames|join(' et ') : teacherName }}</div>
</div>

<table class="qp-id">
    <tr><th>Établissement</th><td>Institution Beaupeyrat</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Année scolaire</th><td>{{ yearLabel ?: '—' }}</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Formation</th><td>{{ program ? program.name : '—' }}</td></tr>
    <tr><th>Matière</th><td>{{ topic ? topic.name : '—' }}</td></tr>
    {% if coAnimated %}
        <tr><th>Formateurs</th><td>
            {% for row in roster %}
                {{ row.teacher.displayName ?? row.teacher.username }}{% if row.groups is not empty %} — groupe {{ row.groups|join(', ') }}{% endif %}
                {%- if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
        </td></tr>
    {% else %}
        <tr><th>Formateur</th><td>{{ teacherName }}</td></tr>
    {% endif %}
    <tr><th>Période couverte</th><td>
        {% if undated %}
            {% if data.firstDay %}{{ fmt.monthRange(data.firstDay, data.lastDay) }}{% else %}<span class="qp-muted">—</span>{% endif %}
        {% else %}
            {% if data.firstDay %}{{ data.firstDay|date('d/m/Y') }} → {{ data.lastDay ? data.lastDay|date('d/m/Y') : '—' }}{% else %}<span class="qp-muted">aucune séance encore placée à l’emploi du temps</span>{% endif %}
        {% endif %}
    </td></tr>
    {# Both figures are learner volumes, so they are comparable - see ProgressionQualiopiBuilder.
       The undated document prints ONE of them: it says nothing about what is placed and what is not,
       so "X placés sur Y prévus" has no meaning there - only the volume received has. #}
    <tr><th>Volume horaire</th><td>
        {% if undated %}
            {{ data.totalCountedMinutes|duration_minutes }} <span class="qp-muted">(heures reçues par un apprenant)</span>
        {% else %}
            {{ data.totalLearnerMinutes|duration_minutes }} placés à l’emploi du temps sur {{ data.totalPlannedMinutes|duration_minutes }} prévus <span class="qp-muted">(heures reçues par un apprenant)</span>
        {% endif %}
    </td></tr>
    <tr><th>Date d’édition</th><td>{{ generatedAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</td></tr>
    {# There is one document, not two: both formateurs export the same one, and it is right that
       they do — what an auditor is handed must not depend on who pressed the button. This row is
       what lets that single document be produced by either of them without either appearing to be
       the sole formateur. #}
    {% if coAnimated and generatedBy is defined and generatedBy %}
        <tr><th>Établi par</th><td>{{ generatedBy.displayName ?? generatedBy.username }}, le {{ generatedAt|date('d/m/Y') }}</td></tr>
    {% endif %}
</table>

{# The claim belongs to the dated document alone: the undated one counts placements nobody
   validated, so "les horaires et les dates proviennent des créneaux de l'emploi du temps" would be
   a statement it cannot back. It carries no replacement note - it says less rather than saying
   something weaker. #}
{% if not undated %}
    <div class="qp-note" style="margin-top: 5mm;">
        Ce document est généré depuis MonCampus à partir des données réelles de la progression : les horaires
        et les dates proviennent des créneaux de l’emploi du temps, les contenus et les méthodes des fiches de
        séquence et de séance propres à cette classe. Aucune valeur n’y est saisie manuellement.
    </div>
{% endif %}

{# ---- 1. Synthèse --------------------------------------------------------- #}
{# Page 1 is the cover: who, what, when, and the note saying where the figures come from. The
   synthèse starts its own page rather than sharing the tail of it, so the document opens on a page
   de garde and every numbered part begins at the top of a page. #}
<h2 class="qp-h2 qp-break">1. Synthèse de l’année</h2>
<p class="qp-crit">Critère 1 — information sur les objectifs, la durée et les modalités · Critère 2 — objectifs adaptés au public.</p>

<div class="qp-kpis">
    <div class="qp-kpi"><div class="qp-kpi__v">{{ data.sequences|length }}</div><div class="qp-kpi__l">Séquences</div></div>
    <div class="qp-kpi"><div class="qp-kpi__v">{{ data.seanceCount }}</div><div class="qp-kpi__l">Séances</div></div>
    <div class="qp-kpi"><div class="qp-kpi__v">{{ (undated ? data.totalCountedMinutes : data.totalLearnerMinutes)|duration_minutes }}</div><div class="qp-kpi__l">Volume / apprenant</div></div>
    <div class="qp-kpi"><div class="qp-kpi__v">{{ data.evaluationCounts.diagnostic }} · {{ data.evaluationCounts.formative }} · {{ data.evaluationCounts.summative }}</div><div class="qp-kpi__l">Éval. D · F · S</div></div>
</div>

{# The undated document drops one column rather than blanking it: « Prévu » against « Délivré » is
   the placed/not-placed question, which it does not ask. What is left is the volume an apprenant
   receives, and the month the séquence runs in. #}
<table class="qp-t">
    <thead><tr><th style="width: 8mm;">#</th><th>Séquence</th><th style="width: 40mm;">Période</th>{% if not undated %}<th style="width: 20mm;">Prévu</th>{% endif %}<th style="width: 22mm;">{{ undated ? 'Volume / apprenant' : 'Délivré / apprenant' }}</th><th style="width: 26mm;">Séances</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for sequence in data.sequences %}
        <tr>
            <td>{{ sequence.position }}</td>
            <td><strong>{{ sequence.title }}</strong></td>
            <td>
                {% if undated %}
                    {% if sequence.firstDay %}{{ fmt.monthRange(sequence.firstDay, sequence.lastDay) }}
                    {%- elseif not sequence.inTimetable %}<span class="qp-muted">hors emploi du temps</span>
                    {%- else %}<span class="qp-muted">—</span>{% endif %}
                {% else %}
                    {% if sequence.firstDay %}{{ sequence.firstDay|date('d/m/y') }} → {{ sequence.lastDay ? sequence.lastDay|date('d/m/y') : '…' }}{% else %}<span class="qp-muted">non placée</span>{% endif %}
                {% endif %}
            </td>
            {% if not undated %}<td>{{ sequence.plannedMinutes|duration_minutes }}</td>{% endif %}
            {# « 0 min » is a figure; a séquence nothing could be counted for has none. The line
               below the table is what explains the gap - the cell only has to stop pretending. #}
            <td>{% if undated and sequence.countedMinutes == 0 %}<span class="qp-muted">—</span>{% else %}{{ (undated ? sequence.countedMinutes : sequence.learnerMinutes)|duration_minutes }}{% endif %}</td>
            <td>
                {{ sequence.seanceCount }}
                {% if not undated and sequence.unplacedCount %}<span class="qp-muted">· {{ sequence.unplacedCount }} non placée{{ sequence.unplacedCount > 1 ? 's' }}</span>{% endif %}
            </td>
        </tr>
    {% else %}
        <tr><td colspan="{{ undated ? 5 : 6 }}" class="qp-muted">Aucune séquence dans cette progression.</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>

{# What the undated document leaves out, said out loud. A séance the year's créneaux cannot hold is
   worth no volume here, so the total comes out short - and a total that is short without saying why
   is the one thing worse than not printing it. Séquences held outside the timetable are named apart
   because they are a decision, not a shortage. #}
{% if undated and (data.uncoveredSeanceCount > 0 or data.outOfTimetableSeanceCount > 0) %}
    <div class="qp-note">
        {% if data.uncoveredSeanceCount > 0 %}
            {{ data.uncoveredSeanceCount }} séance{{ data.uncoveredSeanceCount > 1 ? 's' }}
            {{ data.uncoveredSeanceCount > 1 ? 'ne sont pas comptées' : 'n’est pas comptée' }} dans les volumes
            ci-dessus : les créneaux de l’année ne suffisent pas à les accueillir.
        {% endif %}
        {% if data.outOfTimetableSeanceCount > 0 %}
            {{ data.outOfTimetableSeanceCount }} séance{{ data.outOfTimetableSeanceCount > 1 ? 's' }}
            {{ data.outOfTimetableSeanceCount > 1 ? 'relèvent' : 'relève' }} d’une séquence tenue hors emploi du
            temps : {{ data.outOfTimetableSeanceCount > 1 ? 'leurs volumes prévus sont comptés' : 'son volume prévu est compté' }},
            sans période.
        {% endif %}
    </div>
{% endif %}

{# The document counts ONE thing, and says which. A séance split by group is given twice by the
   trainer, but each learner only receives one of them: it is the hours received that are counted
   here, and the splitting is named slot by slot in the detailed progression. #}
{# Two sentences and not one, because an auditor asks a different question of each situation:
   « données en même temps par deux formateurs » and « redonnées plus tard par le même » are
   different facts, and the single old sentence asserted the second of BOTH — which was false for a
   co-animated séance, in an audit file. The conclusion is unchanged and stays where it was. #}
{% if data.perGroupSeanceCount > 0 %}
    <div class="qp-note">
        <strong>Une lecture unique : les heures reçues par un apprenant.</strong>
        {% if data.coAnimatedSeanceCount > 0 %}
            {{ data.coAnimatedSeanceCount }} séance{{ data.coAnimatedSeanceCount > 1 ? 's' }} de cette progression
            {{ data.coAnimatedSeanceCount > 1 ? 'sont co-animées' : 'est co-animée' }} :
            elle{{ data.coAnimatedSeanceCount > 1 ? 's sont données' : ' est donnée' }} simultanément aux deux groupes,
            dans deux salles, par les formateurs nommés ci-dessus.
        {% endif %}
        {% if data.redeliveredSeanceCount > 0 %}
            {{ data.redeliveredSeanceCount }} séance{{ data.redeliveredSeanceCount > 1 ? 's' }}
            {{ data.redeliveredSeanceCount > 1 ? 'sont redispensées' : 'est redispensée' }} :
            le même formateur {{ data.redeliveredSeanceCount > 1 ? 'les donne' : 'la donne' }} une seconde fois
            à l’autre groupe, sur un créneau distinct.
        {% endif %}
        {% if data.coAnimatedSeanceCount == 0 and data.redeliveredSeanceCount == 0 %}
            {{ data.perGroupSeanceCount }} séance{{ data.perGroupSeanceCount > 1 ? 's' }} de cette progression
            {{ data.perGroupSeanceCount > 1 ? 'sont données' : 'est donnée' }} par groupe.
        {% endif %}
        Dans tous les cas, la séance n’est comptée qu’une fois dans les volumes ci-dessus, puisqu’un
        apprenant n’assiste qu’à celle de son groupe. Le détail figure au § 2, sur le créneau concerné.
    </div>
{% endif %}

{# The year's list of moyens et supports is deliberately NOT printed here: the same information is
   given where it is evidence rather than inventory - phase by phase, in the "Moyens et supports"
   column of § 3. `data.methodSummary` is still built (and tested), so restoring the block is a
   template change alone. #}

{# ---- 2. Progression détaillée ------------------------------------------- #}
<h2 class="qp-h2 qp-break">2. Progression détaillée</h2>
<p class="qp-crit">Critère 2 — objectifs et séquencement · Critère 3 — moyens, méthodes et modalités d’évaluation.</p>

{% for sequence in data.sequences %}
    <div class="qp-seq">
        <div class="qp-seq__head">
            {# Computed from THIS séquence's deliveries and never inherited from the progression: a
               co-animated matière holds very well a séquence the titulaire runs alone with the whole
               class, and marking that one would be a false statement of the same family as the one
               § 1 used to print. #}
            <div class="qp-seq__title">{{ sequence.position }}. {{ sequence.title }}{% if sequence.coAnimated %}<span class="qp-coanim">Co-animée</span>{% endif %}</div>
            <div class="qp-seq__meta">
                {% if sequence.deliveredBy is not empty %}{{ sequence.deliveredBy|join(' et ') }} · {% endif %}
                {% if undated %}
                    {% if sequence.firstDay %}{{ fmt.monthRange(sequence.firstDay, sequence.lastDay) }}{% elseif not sequence.inTimetable %}hors emploi du temps{% else %}aucun créneau disponible{% endif %}
                    {%- if sequence.countedMinutes > 0 %} · {{ sequence.countedMinutes|duration_minutes }} par apprenant{% endif %}
                {% else %}
                    {% if sequence.firstDay %}{{ sequence.firstDay|date('d/m/Y') }} → {{ sequence.lastDay ? sequence.lastDay|date('d/m/Y') : '…' }} · {% endif %}
                    {{ sequence.learnerMinutes|duration_minutes }} placés sur {{ sequence.plannedMinutes|duration_minutes }} prévus par apprenant
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>

        {% set fields = {
            'Objectifs': sequence.objectifs,
            'Capacités attendues': sequence.capacites,
            'Prérequis': sequence.preRequis,
            'Situation problématique': sequence.situation,
            'Transversalités': sequence.transversalites,
            'Supports généraux': sequence.supports,
            'Différenciation': sequence.differentiation,
        } %}
        {% for label, value in fields %}
            {% if value is not empty %}
                <div class="qp-field"><span class="qp-field__l">{{ label }} :</span> <span class="qp-prose">{{ value|striptags('<p><br><ul><ol><li><strong><em>')|raw }}</span></div>
            {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}

        {# One row per séance. A séance dédoublée par groupe stays one row and lists its deliveries
           inside the "Séances / groupes" cell - repeating the row made the year look longer. #}
        <table class="qp-t qp-t--tight">
            <thead><tr><th>Séance</th><th style="width: 16mm;">Durée</th><th style="width: 56mm;">Séance(s) / groupe</th><th style="width: 20mm;">Évaluation</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
            {% for seance in sequence.seances %}
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>{{ seance.title }}</strong></td>
                    {# The duration one apprenant receives. A séance still waiting for a créneau has
                       delivered nothing, so it prints what it plans to.

                       The undated document prints the volume it counted, and a dash where it counted
                       nothing - a séance the year's créneaux cannot hold. Printing its planned
                       duration there would put in the column a figure the total does not contain. #}
                    <td>
                        {% if undated %}
                            {% if seance.countedMinutes is null %}<span class="qp-muted">—</span>{% else %}{{ seance.countedMinutes|duration_minutes }}{% endif %}
                        {% elseif seance.deliveries is empty %}
                            {{ seance.plannedMinutes|duration_minutes }} <span class="qp-muted">(prévu)</span>
                        {% else %}
                            {{ seance.learnerMinutes|duration_minutes }}
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        {# The undated document keeps the GROUPS and drops everything dated. The
                           groups are not decoration: they are what justifies the learner-hour rule
                           below, and a volume counted once for a séance given twice would be
                           unexplainable without them. #}
                        {% if undated %}
                            {% for delivery in seance.deliveries %}
                                <strong>{{ delivery.group ?: 'classe entière' }}</strong>
                                {% if delivery.teacher %}<span class="qp-muted">· {{ delivery.teacher }}</span>{% endif %}
                                {% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
                            {% else %}
                                <span class="qp-muted">{{ sequence.inTimetable ? 'aucun créneau disponible' : 'hors emploi du temps' }}</span>
                            {% endfor %}
                        {% else %}
                        {% for delivery in seance.deliveries %}
                            {{ delivery.date ? delivery.date|date('d/m/Y') : '—' }}
                            {% if delivery.start %}· {{ delivery.start }}{% if delivery.end %}–{{ delivery.end }}{% endif %}{% endif %}
                            · <strong>{{ delivery.group ?: 'classe entière' }}</strong>
                            {% if delivery.room %}<span class="qp-muted">· {{ delivery.room }}</span>{% endif %}
                            {# Two lines at the same hour with two different rooms are otherwise
                               unreadable — the same reason the placement picker needs the name. #}
                            {% if delivery.teacher %}<span class="qp-muted">· {{ delivery.teacher }}</span>{% endif %}
                            {% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}
                        {% else %}
                            <span class="qp-muted">non placée à l’emploi du temps</span>
                        {% endfor %}
                        {% endif %}
                        {# A placement the teacher has not validated is the planner's proposal, and
                           the next replan may move it - it is shown, never counted. #}
                        {% if seance.proposals is not empty %}
                            <span class="qp-redelivery">
                                Proposition de placement non validée :
                                {%- for proposal in seance.proposals %}
                                    {{ ' ' }}{{ proposal.date ? proposal.date|date('d/m/Y') : '—' }}{% if proposal.start %} · {{ proposal.start }}{% endif %}
                                    {%- if proposal.group %} · {{ proposal.group }}{% endif %}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
                                {%- endfor %}.
                            </span>
                        {% endif %}
                        {# Says in words why two créneaux carry one volume - the question an auditor
                           asks of this exact cell. #}
                        {# « Redispensée » is kept for what it describes: the SAME formateur giving the
                           séance a second time, on a distinct créneau. #}
                        {% if seance.redeliveries is not empty %}
                            <span class="qp-redelivery">
                                Séance par groupe, redispensée
                                {%- for redelivery in seance.redeliveries %}
                                    {%- if not undated %}{{ ' ' }}le {{ redelivery.date ? redelivery.date|date('d/m/Y') : '—' }}{% if redelivery.start %} à {{ redelivery.start }}{% endif %}{% endif %}
                                    {{ ' ' }}au groupe {{ redelivery.group ?: '—' }}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
                                {%- endfor %} : comptée une fois, un apprenant n’assistant qu’à celle de son groupe.
                            </span>
                        {% endif %}
                        {# And a co-delivery gets its own sentence, because nothing is redispensed and
                           the créneau is not distinct: the two deliveries are simultaneous, in two
                           rooms, by two formateurs. #}
                        {% if seance.coDeliveries is not empty %}
                            <span class="qp-redelivery">
                                Séance co-animée : donnée simultanément
                                {%- for coDelivery in seance.coDeliveries %}
                                    {{ ' ' }}au groupe {{ coDelivery.group ?: '—' }}
                                    {%- if coDelivery.teacher %} par {{ coDelivery.teacher }}{% endif %}
                                    {%- if coDelivery.room %}, en {{ coDelivery.room }}{% endif %}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
                                {%- endfor %} — comptée une fois, un apprenant n’assistant qu’à celle de son groupe.
                            </span>
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td>{% if seance.nature %}<span class="qp-nature qp-nature--{{ seance.nature.slug }}">{{ seance.nature.labelKey|trans }}</span>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
                </tr>
            {% else %}
                <tr><td colspan="4" class="qp-muted">Aucune séance.</td></tr>
            {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
{% endfor %}

{# ---- 3. Methods: the running order, séance by séance --------------------- #}
<h2 class="qp-h2 qp-break">3. Méthodes pédagogiques — déroulé des séances</h2>
<p class="qp-crit">Critère 3 — les méthodes réellement mises en œuvre : ce que fait le formateur, ce que fait l’apprenant, et avec quels supports.</p>

{# One déroulé per séance, its deliveries named in the heading: the groups follow the same method, so
   a second identical table would pad the document without adding evidence. #}
{% set anyPhase = false %}
{% for sequence in data.sequences %}
    {% for seance in sequence.seances %}
        {% if seance.phases is not empty %}
            {% set anyPhase = true %}
            <div class="qp-seq">
                <h3 class="qp-h3">
                    {{ sequence.position }}. {{ sequence.title }} — {{ seance.title }}
                    {# The undated document names the groups alone, and nothing at all when the
                       séance is taught to the whole class - a parenthesis reading "(classe entière)"
                       on every heading of the § is noise. #}
                    {% if seance.deliveries|length %}
                        {% if undated %}
                            {% set groups = seance.deliveries|map(d => d.group)|filter(g => g is not empty) %}
                            {% if groups is not empty %}<span class="qp-seq__meta">({{ groups|join(' — ') }})</span>{% endif %}
                        {% else %}
                            <span class="qp-seq__meta">({% for d in seance.deliveries %}{{ d.date ? d.date|date('d/m/Y') : '—' }}{% if d.group %} · {{ d.group }}{% endif %}{% if not loop.last %} — {% endif %}{% endfor %})</span>
                        {% endif %}
                    {% endif %}
                </h3>
                {% if seance.objectifs is not empty %}
                    <div class="qp-field"><span class="qp-field__l">Objectifs de la séance :</span> <span class="qp-prose">{{ seance.objectifs|striptags('<p><br><ul><ol><li><strong><em>')|raw }}</span></div>
                {% endif %}
                <table class="qp-t qp-t--tight">
                    <thead><tr><th style="width: 32mm;">Phase</th><th style="width: 14mm;">Durée</th><th>Activité du formateur</th><th>Activité de l’apprenant</th><th style="width: 34mm;">Moyens et supports</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                    {% for phase in seance.phases %}
                        <tr>
                            <td><strong>{{ phase.name }}</strong>{% if phase.contenu is not empty %}<br><span class="qp-muted">{{ phase.contenu|striptags }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
                            <td>{{ phase.minutes is not null ? phase.minutes|duration_minutes : '—' }}</td>
                            <td>{{ phase.teacher is not empty ? phase.teacher|striptags : '—' }}</td>
                            <td>{{ phase.student is not empty ? phase.student|striptags : '—' }}</td>
                            <td>{{ phase.means is not empty ? phase.means|striptags : '—' }}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
{% endfor %}

{% if not anyPhase %}
    <div class="qp-note">
        Aucun déroulé n’est renseigné sur les séances de cette progression. Le déroulé se saisit depuis la
        fiche de chaque séance ; il constitue la pièce attendue au titre du critère 3 (méthodes et moyens).
    </div>
{% endif %}

{# ---- 4. Évaluations ------------------------------------------------------ #}
<h2 class="qp-h2">4. Modalités d’évaluation des acquis</h2>
<p class="qp-crit">Critère 7 — évaluation de l’atteinte des objectifs par les bénéficiaires, dans ses trois temps : diagnostique, formative, sommative.</p>

{# The undated document drops the column, including for the évaluations posées au carnet de notes,
   which carry a date of their own rather than a placement's: a document that says it prints no date
   must not print one because that one happens to be solid. The rows keep their chronological order,
   which is what makes the list read as a year. #}
<table class="qp-t">
    <thead><tr>{% if not undated %}<th style="width: 22mm;">Date</th>{% endif %}<th>Évaluation</th><th style="width: 52mm;">Séquence</th><th style="width: 24mm;">Nature</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for row in data.evaluationRows %}
        <tr>
            {% if not undated %}<td>{{ row.date ? row.date|date('d/m/Y') : '—' }}</td>{% endif %}
            <td><strong>{{ row.title }}</strong></td>
            <td>{{ row.sequence ?: 'hors séquence' }}</td>
            <td><span class="qp-nature qp-nature--{{ row.nature.slug }}">{{ row.nature.labelKey|trans }}</span></td>
        </tr>
    {% else %}
        <tr><td colspan="{{ undated ? 3 : 4 }}" class="qp-muted">Aucune évaluation posée sur cette progression.</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
</table>

</body>
</html>
